      <file>projects/spaarke-ai-architecture-redesign-r1/notes/audit-inputs/OVERLAY-MATRIX.md</file>
    </files>
  </knowledge>

  <context>
    <background>
      Batch contents (inventory §5.4 + §9 remainder + migration-map start-now list):
      (1) `docs/ai-knowledge/catalogs/` twin of `scope-model-index.json` — divergent taxonomy vs seed data, generated 2026-03-05 (the kept `.claude/catalogs/` copy is refreshed by task 051);
      (2) `scripts/seed-data/actions.json` + `scripts/seed-data/playbooks.json` (2026-01 R4 taxonomy, superseded);
      (3) `scripts/Seed-JpsActions.ps1` (sources from project-notes dirs, likely broken);
      (4) 2026-02 ERD docs: `docs/data-model/sprk_ERD-ai-analysis-entities.md` + `docs/data-model/sprk_ai-analysis-related-entities.md` (show dropped `sprk_actiontypeid`; misleading — replacements authored by task 052 at P4);
      (5) verify-first remainder from §9: `FallbackScopeCatalog`/`FallbackPrompts` (flagged "(verify)") and `LoadKnowledgeNodeExecutor` (R4 placeholder) — delete if grep proves dead, else keep-with-reason.
    </background>
    <dependencies>
      <dependency task="none" status="complete">No dependencies — rides wave W-P1-A.</dependency>
    </dependencies>
    <related-work>
      <item>Task 051 (FR-P4-02) refreshes the single kept `.claude/catalogs/scope-model-index.json` and regenerates Seed-PlaybookConsumers.ps1 — this batch clears the stale twins first</item>
      <item>Task 052 (FR-P4-03) authors the replacement data-model docs for the deleted ERDs</item>
      <item>Task 050 (FR-P4-01) completion audit consumes this batch's evidence file</item>
    </related-work>
  </context>

  <steps>
    <step order="0" name="Context check">
      Check context usage. If &gt; 70%, create handoff summary and request new chat. Load inputs; read inventory §5.4 (stale manifest surface) and §9, plus the migration map Track-B list.
    </step>
    <step order="1" name="Read and confirm the batch list">
      Glob/Grep exact paths for all five item groups. For the verify-first items (FallbackScopeCatalog/FallbackPrompts, LoadKnowledgeNodeExecutor): enumerate every consumer; rule delete vs keep-with-reason with evidence. Confirm no script or doc references the seed JSONs / Seed-JpsActions.ps1 in live tooling.
    </step>
    <step order="2" name="Delete the batch">
      Delete the confirmed items: docs/ai-knowledge/catalogs/ twin, the two R4 seed JSONs, Seed-JpsActions.ps1, the two 2026-02 ERD docs, and any verify-first item ruled dead. Remove dangling references (e.g., docs/data-model/INDEX.md links to the deleted ERDs may be left for task 052's full INDEX reconcile — note the choice in evidence).
    </step>
    <step order="3" name="Grep-zero verification (SHOWN)">
      For each deleted file/symbol (`scope-model-index` under docs/ai-knowledge, `Seed-JpsActions`, `sprk_ERD-ai-analysis-entities`, `sprk_ai-analysis-related-entities`, seed-data JSON paths, plus any deleted verify-first symbol): grep/glob across the repo and SHOW zero-hit output outside git history and outside this project's audit notes (audit-input citations are expected survivors — note them).
    </step>
    <step order="4" name="Build verification (SHOWN)">
      If any code surface was touched (verify-first deletions): run `dotnet build src/server/api/Sprk.Bff.Api/` and show green output. Docs/scripts-only deletions: state that no build surface was touched and show the git status delta instead.
    </step>
    <step order="5" name="Evidence + close">
      Write `projects/spaarke-ai-architecture-redesign-r1/notes/track-b/batch-4-evidence.md` (item table: deleted-path / grep output / keep-with-reason incl. the verify-first rulings). Update TASK-INDEX.md (073 → ✅). Report completion.
    </step>
  </steps>

  <tools>
    <tool name="dotnet">Build verification if code touched</tool>
    <tool name="git">Version control (deletions preserved in history)</tool>
  </tools>

  <outputs>
    <output type="docs">docs/ai-knowledge/catalogs/ (twin deleted) · docs/data-model/ (2 ERD docs deleted)</output>
    <output type="code">scripts/seed-data/ + scripts/Seed-JpsActions.ps1 (deleted); Services/Ai verify-first deletions if ruled dead</output>
    <output type="report">projects/spaarke-ai-architecture-redesign-r1/notes/track-b/batch-4-evidence.md</output>
    <output type="docs">projects/spaarke-ai-architecture-redesign-r1/tasks/TASK-INDEX.md (status update)</output>
  </outputs>

  <acceptance-criteria>
    <criterion testable="true">Per-batch grep-zero for every deleted item outside git history, with output SHOWN (FR-TB-01 / NFR-08).</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">Builds green for any touched code surface with output shown (or explicit no-code-touched statement with git delta).</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">`.claude/catalogs/scope-model-index.json` is untouched by this task; only the docs/ai-knowledge twin is deleted.</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">Verify-first items (FallbackScopeCatalog/FallbackPrompts, LoadKnowledgeNodeExecutor) each carry a delete-with-evidence or keep-with-reason ruling in the evidence file.</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">notes/track-b/batch-4-evidence.md exists with the per-item evidence table; TASK-INDEX updated.</criterion>
  </acceptance-criteria>

  <execution>
